BaseConfigLib::unpackUint128
├── given zero packed value
│   └── it should return (0, 0)
├── given only lower bits set
│   └── it should return (lower, 0)
├── given only upper bits set
│   └── it should return (0, upper)
├── given both set
│   └── it should return both values correctly
└── given max packed value
    └── it should return (max, max)